The map's data, as IP-rotator (OK1HRA) builds it:

map50.js        LAND_OUTLINES (land, Natural Earth 1:50m countries), COUNTRY_BORDERS
                (Natural Earth admin 0 + admin 1 lines), DXCC_PREFIX_LABELS
                ([lat×100, lon×100, prefix, area, name]) — coordinates ×100.
                Natural Earth is in the public domain (naturalearthdata.com).
dxcc_prefix_aliases.js  a call's prefix → its DXCC label (canonicalizeDxccPrefixAlias).
states.js       STATE_ABBR_LABELS — US states / VE provinces for the prefix layer.

Taken from the IP-rotator web filesystem of 2026-09-13; a new copy replaces
these files as they are.
